   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# NHS Hospital Admitted Patient Care — Data Quality & Automation Project\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "This project evaluates the structure, completeness, and reliability of NHS Hospital Admitted Patient Care data (2024–25). The goal is to design a reproducible, automated data quality pipeline that can be applied in healthcare analytics and generalized to other industries.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Why This Matters\n",
    "Healthcare decisions rely on accurate data. Poor data quality can lead to misallocation of resources, incorrect policy decisions, and patient harm. This project demonstrates how analysts proactively detect and document data quality issues before analysis."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "c647edda-31c3-4676-9724-13a6796abe0f",
